            Dev Console
        </a>
        <a href="/admin/vault" class="nav-item">
            <svg class="nav-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"><path d="M12 2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2zM4.93 4.93a2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0l1.41 1.41a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 2.83L4.93 7.76a2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83zM19.07 4.93a2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83l-1.41 1.41a2 2 0 0 1-2.83-2.83l1.41-1.41a2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0zM2 12a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2a2 2 0 0 1 0 4H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2zM20 12a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2a2 2 0 0 1 0 4h-2a2 2 0 0 1-2-2zM4.93 19.07a2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83l1.41-1.41a2 2 0 0 1 2.83 2.83l-1.41 1.41a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0zM19.07 19.07a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0l-1.41-1.41a2 2 0 0 1 2.83-2.83l1.41 1.41a2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83zM12 20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z"/></svg>
            Custom Bot
        </a>
    </nav>

    <div class="sb-footer">
        <div class="user-pill">
            <div class="user-av"><%- username.charAt(0).toUpperCase() %></div>
